DESCRIPTION:Logan Guntzelman is a Los Angeles-based comedian/writer. She wa
 s most recently selected as a New Face at the Just for Laughs Comedy Festiv
 al in Montreal\, where she also made it to the final four in the Roastmaste
 r’s Invitational. She performs and tours in clubs and rooms all over the 
 country\, and has been selected to perform in the New York Comedy Festival\
 , Boston Comedy Festival\, 10\,000 Laughs Minneapolis\, Echo Park Rising\, 
 CROMFest Denver\, and the Chicago Comedy Expo. She’s also currently undef
 eated in the World Famous Comedy Store’s Roast Battle and was a finalist 
 in the Westside Comedy Theater's Comedy Showdown. She received $75 dollars 
 as prize\, which she has since used to pay her brother for their shared pho
 ne plan. They have T-mobile\, and they don't really care for it.\n\nPLEASE 
